          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="fixed:18.00" defaultTabSize="72"><strong><span color="rgba(22, 34, 46, 1)" fontSize="12.5" fontFamily="Heiti SC" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">限定「显著 run」后，UWS 组在问答阶段的解码准确率反而高于 MCS 组（p = 0.049）。</span></strong></p>
        </content>
