        <content verticalAlign="top" fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" textAlign="left">
          <ul listStyle="pptx-bullet">
            <li>
              <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="fixed:16.50" afterLineSpacing="fixed:6.00" marginLeft="14" indent="0" defaultTabSize="72" bulletSize="100%"><span color="rgba(22, 34, 46, 1)" fontSize="11.5" fontFamily="Heiti SC" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">解释 A：问答由熟悉的照护者／亲属录音，情感显著性提升了 UWS 患者的投入度。</span></p>
            </li>
            <li>
              <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="fixed:16.50" afterLineSpacing="fixed:6.00" marginLeft="14" indent="0" defaultTabSize="72" bulletSize="100%"><span color="rgba(22, 34, 46, 1)" fontSize="11.5" fontFamily="Heiti SC" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">解释 B：UWS 组本身被标准行为学评估系统性低估。</span></p>
            </li>
            <li>
              <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="fixed:16.50" afterLineSpacing="fixed:6.00" marginLeft="14" indent="0" defaultTabSize="72" bulletSize="100%"><span color="rgba(22, 34, 46, 1)" fontSize="11.5" fontFamily="Heiti SC" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">作者并列给出两种解释，并未区分——这正是「MI-BCI 可能发现被漏掉的人」的最强线索，也仍是待检验的问题。</span></p>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </content>
